‹AlertWarning:▎ ›‹AlertWarning,b:󰀪 Warning›
‹AlertWarning:▎ ›Drawer keys never reach a covered pane; ‹Code: leader h › goes back to the master.

‹QuoteBar:▎ ›‹QuoteText:Reviewing is reading. The drawer should never make you wait for it.›
‹QuoteBar:▎ ›
‹QuoteBar:▎ ›  ‹Bullet:• ›‹QuoteText:the first rule of review›
‹QuoteBar:▎ ›  ‹Bullet:• ›‹Image:󰥶 A quoted screenshot  ›‹ImageHost:example.com›
‹QuoteBar:▎ ›
‹QuoteBar:▎ ›‹SummaryMark,b:▾ ›‹Summary,b:Quoted notes›
‹QuoteBar:▎ ›  ‹QuoteText:Open by default, inside a quote.›

‹AlertTip:▎ ›‹AlertTip,b:󰌶 Tip›
‹AlertTip:▎ ›Open the drawer before the agent finishes to watch the diff grow.

‹AlertImportant:▎ ›‹AlertImportant,b:󰨄 Important›
‹AlertImportant:▎ ›Merging always needs the reviewed head.

‹AlertCaution:▎ ›‹AlertCaution,b:󰳦 Caution›
‹AlertCaution:▎ ›The drawer reads the worktree, so unsaved edits do not show.

